+
+```bash
+corepack npm run build
+npm pack
+mkdir /tmp/scwbs-consumer
+cd /tmp/scwbs-consumer
+npm init -y
+npm install --save-dev /path/to/scwbs-0.1.0.tgz
+npx scwbs --version
